    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Herolike: An Unfortunate Isekai</strong>\u00a0is a turn based RPG. It features linear story progression, side quests, hidden abilities and some NSFW scenes that are (mostly) optional.\u00a0Go through 9 dungeons, collecting new friends who will join you in your adventure. Battle monsters and complete dungeons to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a total of 8 companions to collect, including your pet dog or cat, and several pieces of armor and equipment to craft. There are hidden abilities scattered throughout the world waiting to be unlocked by the new hero of the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet our heroine:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3436450/extras/9bd7d876545e6b44482683fd27fce755.avif?t=1738790039\" width=800 height=1169 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She gets teleported to another world as the 'Chosen Hero.' After being transported to the new world, we find our hero is reluctant to do what she is told. She is a bit promiscuous, and tends to spend more time having dirty thoughts than caring about the world around her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a total of 8 companions to collect, and several pieces of armor and equipment to craft. There are hidden abilities scattered throughout the world waiting to be unlocked by the hero as she finds them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once all is said and done, you must decide the fate of this world and choose if you will return home, or stay in the new land.</p>",
